  "shortdescription" : "^orange;Alta Ionomelter^reset;",
  "description" : "An ^#b0e0fc;alta^reset; energy furnace for smelting ores and processing materials using ^#60c0fc;ionic energy^reset;.",
  "longdescription" : "The Alta Ionomelter is a tier 6 advanced furnace that harnesses ^#60c0fc;ionic^reset; and ^#2080f0;plasma^reset; energy to smelt ores, refine compounds, and process building materials. Unlike traditional combustion furnaces, it uses concentrated energy beams to heat materials to extreme temperatures with precise control. The station can smelt metals, create ^#60c0fc;bion compounds^reset;, process ^#20f080;moonrock^reset; and sandbricks, and refine various ^#20f080;alterash^reset; materials into usable forms.",
  "altaDescription" : "My energy smelter! It uses ionic beams instead of flames, so it's much more efficient and precise than old furnaces~",

